AI mask models
  Downloaded the first time a mask needs them, after asking; not shipped. Each has its own
  terms:
    Subject and Background: silueta, a pruned U²-Net, from rembg
      (https://github.com/danielgatis/rembg). Apache-2.0.
    Sky and People: SegFormer-B0 trained on ADE20K, exported by Xenova
      (https://huggingface.co/Xenova/segformer-b0-finetuned-ade-512-512). NVIDIA's SegFormer
      licence: research and evaluation only, NOT for commercial use.
    Select Object: MobileSAM, exported by Acly (https://huggingface.co/Acly/MobileSAM).
      Apache-2.0.


